# Edge of Existence (WotG 40) in Rolanberry Fields: the Cavernous Maw plays 502 [1, 26, 83764, 22093, 466180, 1822,
# 648024]; its finish completes the mission (Her Memories current), then xi.maws.goToMaw gets the zone's id where it
# wants a maw table and raises "attempt to index local 'maw' (a number value)" (the step's expect-error): the char stays
# where it is.
lists RolanberryFields/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger RolanberryFields/onEventFinish/502
char zone=RolanberryFields pos=-198,8,361 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg EdgeOfExistence current
login
trigger Cavernous_Maw                      # 502
finish expect-error "attempt to index local 'maw' (a number value)"
